    "title": "VC Election 2026: Two look to fill Irwin's shoes for State Assembly Dist. 42 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Alex Wilson ,\n21 hours ago Voters in California Assembly District 42 have a choice in the Nov. 3 General Election between Republican medical-device business owner Ted Nordblum and Agoura Hills Mayor Pro Tem Deborah Klein Lopez, a Democrat. The district is centered on Thousand Oaks and includes surrounding communities including Malibu, Simi Valley, Calabasas and parts of Camarillo. Read full article\n1",
